1
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,450
赤い扇をひらいて
I open my red fan

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,440
ひと目でめまいする
one glance and you're dizzy

3
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,760
しなやかに くるり
supple, I spin around

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,830
足音まで甘い
even my footsteps are sweet

5
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:25,500
髪のかんざし揺れて
the pin in my hair sways

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,320
視線をさらってく
stealing every gaze

7
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,170
にこっと笑うたび
every time I smile

8
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:36,240
夜が少し熱い
the night runs a little warmer

9
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,310
こっち向いて
look this way

10
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,030
もっと近くで
come closer

11
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,050
秘密みたいに
like a secret

12
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,250
指先を合わせて
let our fingertips touch

13
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,750
息を止めて
hold your breath

14
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,840
でも逃げないで
but don't run away

15
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,740
今夜だけは
just for tonight

16
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,480
きみの負けだよ
you lose to me

17
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,370
Dance! Dance! Dance!

18
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,010
くるくる回って
spin round and round

19
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,180
Dance! Dance! Dance!

20
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,610
かわいく誘って
lure them in, so cute

21
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,290
